---
/**
 * Illustrative HTML/CSS mockup of a ScholarMark project. Every name, sentence and
 * page number below is invented sample content; it is not a product screenshot.
 */
---

<figure class="ws" aria-labelledby="ws-caption" aria-describedby="ws-description">
  <div class="ws__frame" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ws__bar">
      <span class="ws__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
      <span class="ws__project">Sample project · Shade and night-time heat</span>
      <span class="ws__badge">Illustration</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ws__body">
      <aside class="ws-sources">
        <p class="ws-label">Sources</p>
        <ul>
          <li class="is-active">
            <span class="ws-file ws-file--pdf">PDF</span>
            <span><b>Neighborhood heat survey</b><small>3 highlights</small></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ws-file ws-file--scan">OCR</span>
            <span><b>Tree canopy field notes</b><small>Scanned · 2 highlights</small></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ws-file ws-file--txt">TXT</span>
            <span><b>Resident interviews</b><small>4 highlights</small></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ws-file ws-file--web">WEB</span>
            <span><b>Transit shelter memo</b><small>1 highlight</small></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </aside>

      <section class="ws-reader">
        <header class="ws-pane-head">
          <span>Neighborhood heat survey</span>
          <span class="ws-page">p. 12</span>
        </header>
        <div class="ws-reader__text">
          <p class="ws-line ws-line--muted">
            Readings were taken at street level between 9 p.m. and 5 a.m. on twelve blocks.
          </p>
          <p class="ws-line">
            <mark class="ws-mark"><span class="ws-pin">1</span>Blocks with the least tree cover stayed
              warmest after midnight, and they cooled the slowest before dawn.</mark>
          </p>
          <p class="ws-line ws-line--muted">
            Survey volunteers recorded shade, pavement type and building height for each block.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ws-note">
          <span class="ws-chip ws-chip--evidence">Evidence</span>
          <p>Supports the section 2 claim about overnight heat. Check the methods on p. 4.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ws-draft">
        <header class="ws-pane-head">
          <span>Draft · Section 2</span>
          <span class="ws-style">Chicago</span>
        </header>
        <p class="ws-draft__text">
          Shade matters most at night. In the survey's twelve blocks, the least-shaded streets
          <span class="ws-quote">"stayed warmest after midnight"</span><span class="ws-nowrap"
            ><span class="ws-cite"><span class="ws-pin">1</span>p. 12</span>,</span
          > which suggests canopy loss compounds overnight heat.
        </p>
        <ul class="ws-checks">
          <li class="ws-check ws-check--ok"><span class="ws-dot"></span>Quote found in source, p. 12</li>
          <li class="ws-check ws-check--review"><span class="ws-dot"></span>Paraphrase: review against source</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p id="ws-description" class="visually-hidden">
    A sample project with four sources in a sidebar. The open source shows a highlighted sentence
    on page 12 with a note tagging it as evidence. Beside it, a draft paragraph quotes part of that
    sentence with a page 12 citation, a check that the quote was found in the source, and a
    reminder that a paraphrase still needs review.
  </p>
  <figcaption id="ws-caption" class="ws__caption">
    Illustration with sample content, not a live screenshot. Highlights, notes and page numbers
    stay attached from source to draft.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ws {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ws__frame {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-frame);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .ws__bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: var(--paper-deep);
  }

  .ws__dots {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .ws__dots i {
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--rule-strong);
  }

  .ws__project {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 550;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ws__badge {
    flex: none;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--muted);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ws__body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

  .ws-label,
  .ws-pane-head {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ws-pane-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ws-page,
  .ws-style {
    padding: 0.05rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--paper-deep);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  /* Sources sidebar */

  .ws-sources {
    padding: 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: #fbf8f2;
  }

  .ws-sources .ws-label {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .ws-sources ul {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .ws-sources li {
    display: flex;
    flex: none;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .ws-sources li.is-active {
    border-color: var(--rule-strong);
    background: var(--card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .ws-sources li:not(.is-active) {
    display: none;
  }

  .ws-sources b {
    display: block;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ws-sources small {
    display: block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .ws-file {
    display: grid;
    flex: none;
    place-items: center;
    width: 2.1rem;
    height: 2.4rem;
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .ws-file--pdf {
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .ws-file--scan {
    background: #5b6b3a;
  }

  .ws-file--txt {
    background: #3f5a7a;
  }

  .ws-file--web {
    background: #6a4f7d;
  }

  /* Reader */

  .ws-reader,
  .ws-draft {
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem 1.15rem;
  }

  .ws-reader {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .ws-reader__text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .ws-line--muted {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .ws-mark {
    padding: 0.05rem 0.15rem;
    border-radius: 0.2rem;
    background: var(--highlight);
    box-shadow: inset 0 -2px 0 var(--highlight-edge);
    color: var(--ink);
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
    box-decoration-break: clone;
  }

  .ws-pin {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.05rem;
    height: 1.05rem;
    margin-right: 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    vertical-align: 0.12em;
  }

  .ws-note {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--ok);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    background: var(--ok-soft);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .ws-chip {
    justify-self: start;
    padding: 0.05rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ws-chip--evidence {
    background: var(--ok);
    color: #fff;
  }

  /* Draft */

  .ws-draft__text {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .ws-quote {
    background: linear-gradient(transparent 62%, var(--highlight) 62%);
  }

  .ws-cite {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-left: 0.2rem;
    padding: 0 0.4rem 0 0.15rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--paper);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
    vertical-align: 0.1em;
  }

  .ws-nowrap {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ws-cite .ws-pin {
    margin-right: 0.25rem;
  }

  .ws-checks {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
    padding: 0.75rem 0 0;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--rule-strong);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .ws-check {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 550;
  }

  .ws-dot {
    flex: none;
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .ws-check--ok {
    color: var(--ok);
  }

  .ws-check--ok .ws-dot {
    background: var(--ok);
  }

  .ws-check--review {
    color: var(--warn);
  }

  .ws-check--review .ws-dot {
    border: 2px solid var(--warn);
  }

  .ws__caption {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Tablet: reader and draft side by side, sources as a row of tabs. */
  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    .ws__body {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .ws-sources {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .ws-sources li:not(.is-active) {
      display: flex;
    }

    .ws-reader {
      border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
      border-bottom: 0;
    }
  }

  /* Desktop: full three-pane workspace. */
  @media (min-width: 68rem) {
    .ws__body {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.78fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      min-height: 22rem;
    }

    .ws-sources {
      grid-column: auto;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .ws-sources ul {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .ws-sources li {
      flex: initial;
    }
  }
</style>
